    "description": "Ten-factor eventual modes; finite-mass entry at most 12m+212 with sharp slope; polynomial bit-time exact first-J10 macros with complete compressed endpoints and quadratic finite-event deadlines; and the all-input inequality 3(t-s)-26(|B_t|-|B_s|) &lt;= 351 N10(s,t)+322 with sharp additive constant. Explicit legal producers create black lifetimes later consumed at violations; a folded finite ribbon has exact autonomous P104 recovery and linear reset cost. Every finite ten-legal physical word lies in one endpoint coordinate strip with padding 43. The original 10n+41-black producer family now has a complete all-parameter autonomous recovery theorem, including exact first entry and intrinsic event counts. Finite-horizon single-core rigidity, sharp ballistic displacement coefficient, one-standard-jump first-event algorithm, and the sharp nine-factor mass-window threshold.",
